{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "layout_version": 4,
  "owners": {
    "stage1": "Stage1Values",
    "stage2": "Stage2Values",
    "gui": "GuiValues",
    "worker": "WorkerValues"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "worktodo",
      "field": "worktodo",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "worktodo.txt",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "queue(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "指定 Stage1 读取的任务队列。程序按当前 worker 领取任务；完成后将原任务移入 finished。Stage2 使用独立的 stage2_worktodo，不要让两个程序同时消费同一文件。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "finished",
      "field": "finished",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "worktodo.finished.txt",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "finished(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "指定 Stage1 已完成任务的记录文件。用于保留原任务行和处理结果，不是曲线计算的中间存档。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "log_file",
      "field": "log_file",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "screen.log",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "log(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "present": "log_file_explicit",
      "worker_suffix": true,
      "empty": "off",
      "description": [
        "指定 Stage1 普通运行日志，程序追加写入。留空关闭文件日志；未显式指定文件名时，worker 2 等自动使用 screen_2.log 这类带编号的文件名。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "tmp_dir",
      "field": "tmp_dir",
      "type": "string",
      "default": ".",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "save_dir(S1,S2)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "指定 Stage1 曲线存档的输出目录。Stage2 未设置 stage2_save_dir 时也在此目录查找任务引用的 save；此键不是 Stage2 全部临时显存或内存的预算。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "save_sync_dir_1",
      "field": "save_sync_dir_1",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "sync(1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "off",
      "description": [
        "指定第一个 Stage1 存档同步目录。留空不启用该目标；同步范围和方式由 sync_mode 决定。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "save_sync_dir_2",
      "field": "save_sync_dir_2",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "sync(2)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "off",
      "description": [
        "指定第二个 Stage1 存档同步目录。可同时向两个目标同步；留空只关闭此目标，不影响第一个目标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "sync_mode",
      "field": "sync_mode",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "incremental",
      "domain": "[incremental|full]",
      "fx": "save_sync",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "控制 Stage1 任务完成后的存档同步。incremental 仅同步本次任务期间更新的文件；full 同步全部符合条件的存档。程序启动时仍执行一次完整同步。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "p95_worktodo_path",
      "field": "p95_worktodo_path",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "handoff(P95)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "off",
      "description": [
        "指定 Prime95 的 worktodo.txt 路径。启用后，将 Stage1 生成的 ECMSTAGE2 任务追加到同目录的 worktodo.add，由 Prime95 自行导入；留空关闭交接。save 文件本身还需能被 Prime95 访问。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "p95_add_workers",
      "field": "p95_add_workers",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[<n>|<n>,...|<a>-<b>|auto]",
      "fx": "workers(P95)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "no_worker_header",
      "description": [
        "选择接收交接任务的 Prime95 worker，可指定单个编号、编号列表或区间；程序在候选 worker 中选择队列较短者。auto 从同目录 prime.txt 读取 NumWorkers；留空追加时不写 worker 段头，按 Prime95 的默认 worker 处理。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "p95_keep_aid",
      "field": "p95_keep_aid",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": true,
      "domain": "[0|1]",
      "fx": "keep(AID)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "控制交接任务是否保留 PrimeNet assignment ID。1 保留未被判定失效的 AID，0 一律去掉；已在 Prime95 日志中确认失效的 AID 会去掉，以免任务再次被丢弃。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "p95_recover_lost",
      "field": "p95_recover_lost",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": true,
      "domain": "[0|1]",
      "fx": "recover(AID)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "控制是否补投被 Prime95 因失效 AID 删除的交接任务。1 根据交接记录和 Prime95 日志检查并去掉 AID 补投，0 关闭自动补投；只对程序能够确认的已交接任务生效。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "progress_color",
      "field": "progress_color",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "cyan",
      "domain": "[none|red|green|yellow|blue|magenta|cyan|white|grey]",
      "fx": "progress_color",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "选择 Stage1 控制台进度文字颜色。none 关闭着色；此设置不改变普通文件日志内容或计算方式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "progress_log_seconds",
      "field": "progress_log_seconds",
      "type": "double",
      "default": 60,
      "domain": "<x:R,finite>",
      "fx": "file_progress_period",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "unit": "s",
      "rules": [
        "x>0:period(x)",
        "x=0:off",
        "x<0:each_line",
        "100%:always"
      ],
      "description": [
        "控制 Stage1 进度行写入日志文件的间隔，单位为秒。正数按间隔记录，0 不记录中间进度，负数记录每次进度更新；完成时的 100% 行仍会记录。此键不限制控制台刷新频率。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "verbose",
      "field": "verbose",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": true,
      "domain": "[0|1]",
      "fx": "console(S1,S2)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "rules": [
        "S2:1=phases;0=curve",
        "debug:independent"
      ],
      "description": [
        "控制普通控制台输出的详细程度。Stage2 中 true 显示阶段切换，false 保留曲线摘要；调试日志由 stage2_debug_log 独立控制。Stage1 按各计算后端的普通详细输出规则处理。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "method",
      "field": "method",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "gpu",
      "domain": "[gpu|edwards|mont]",
      "fx": "engine(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "value_aliases": {
        "gpu": [
          "opencl"
        ],
        "edwards": [
          "atkin-morain"
        ],
        "mont": [
          "montgomery",
          "suyama"
        ]
      },
      "empty": "default",
      "description": [
        "选择 Stage1 计算方法。gpu 使用当前可执行文件链接的 GPU 后端：ecm_cuda 使用 CUDA，ecm 使用 OpenCL；edwards 和 mont 使用对应的 CPU 曲线实现。改为 gpu 不会在同一可执行文件内切换 CUDA 与 OpenCL。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "backend",
      "field": "backend",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "auto",
      "domain": "[auto|simd|gmp]",
      "fx": "CPU_mul",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "value_aliases": {
        "simd": [
          "avx512"
        ],
        "gmp": [
          "scalar",
          "mpn"
        ]
      },
      "rules": [
        "simd=>AVX512-IFMA"
      ],
      "empty": "default",
      "description": [
        "选择 CPU Edwards/Montgomery 的大整数乘法后端。auto 自动选择，simd 使用受支持的 AVX512-IFMA 路径，gmp 使用 GMP；GPU Stage1 不使用此设置。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "field",
      "field": "field",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "auto",
      "domain": "[auto|mersenne|montgomery]",
      "fx": "CPU_SIMD_reduce",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "value_aliases": {
        "mersenne": [
          "mers",
          "on",
          "fold"
        ],
        "montgomery": [
          "mont",
          "off",
          "cios"
        ]
      },
      "rules": [
        "mersenne=>N=2^p-1"
      ],
      "empty": "default",
      "description": [
        "选择 CPU SIMD 的模约减方法。auto 按输入数选择，mersenne 适用于 N=2^p-1，montgomery 使用通用 Montgomery 约减；GPU Stage1 不使用此设置。通常保持 auto。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "stage1_threads",
      "field": "stage1_threads",
      "type": "u32",
      "default": 0,
      "domain": "<x:Z,0..2^32-1>",
      "fx": "CPU_threads",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "zero": "auto",
      "description": [
        "设置 CPU Stage1 的线程数。0 自动选择；只影响 CPU 计算路径，不改变 CUDA 的线程块大小或每个大整数使用的线程数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "affinity",
      "field": "affinity",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[none|auto|<n>,...|<a>-<b>]",
      "fx": "CPU_affinity",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "OS",
      "rules": [
        "n<logical_CPU_count"
      ],
      "description": [
        "设置 CPU Stage1 计算线程的亲和性，可用逻辑 CPU 编号列表或区间；线程依次循环使用列表中的 CPU。空值、none 或 auto 均不主动绑定，由操作系统调度。当前 Windows 实现只对单处理器组内编号 0..63 生效，其他平台不执行此绑定；编号还须对应实际可用的逻辑 CPU。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "save_name_pattern",
      "field": "save_name_pattern",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "m{n}_{b1}.save",
      "domain": "<pattern>",
      "fx": "save_name(CPU_mont)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "rules": [
        "tokens:{n},{b1}",
        "suffix:_<B1>.save"
      ],
      "empty": "default",
      "description": [
        "设置 CPU Montgomery 存档的名称模式，{n} 表示输入指数，{b1} 表示 B1。留空恢复默认模式；此键不改变其他计算后端自己的文件命名规则。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "exp_cache",
      "field": "exp_cache",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[off|none|0|-|<dir>]",
      "fx": "cache(lcm)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "exe_dir",
      "path_base": "process_CWD(nonempty)",
      "rules": [
        "[off|none|0|-]:disabled",
        "case:sensitive"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 Stage1 指数缓存目录，复用相同 B1 和指数模式的预计算结果。留空使用可执行文件目录；off、none、0 或 - 关闭缓存。显式相对目录以进程当前工作目录为基准；很小的 B1 可能直接计算而不写缓存。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "naf_w",
      "field": "naf_w",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 0,
      "domain": "[0|3..12]",
      "fx": "Edwards_NAF",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "zero": "12",
      "rules": [
        "recommended",
        "runtime:x=0|x>=2",
        "dict=2^(x-2)"
      ],
      "description": [
        "设置 CPU Edwards 的 NAF 窗口。0 使用内置窗口；增大窗口通常减少主循环加法，但预计算字典按 2^(w-2) 增长，会增加内存和准备时间。通常使用 3..12；CUDA PRAC 不使用此设置。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "exponent",
      "field": "exponent",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "lcm",
      "domain": "[lcm|choose12]",
      "fx": "exponent(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "value_aliases": {
        "lcm": [
          "1",
          "gmp",
          "gmp-ecm"
        ],
        "choose12": [
          "12",
          "prime95"
        ]
      },
      "rules": [
        "lcm:lcm(1..B1)",
        "choose12:12*lcm(1..B1)"
      ],
      "empty": "default",
      "description": [
        "选择 Stage1 使用的指数。lcm 为 lcm(1..B1)，choose12 为 12*lcm(1..B1)，用于需要额外乘 12 的流程；该设置改变计算结果，接续 Stage2 时应与所用曲线和存档约定一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "sigma",
      "field": "sigma",
      "type": "u64",
      "default": 0,
      "domain": "<x:Z,0..2^64-1>",
      "fx": "first_sigma",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "zero": "random",
      "rules": [
        "curve(i):sigma+i",
        "Suyama:x>=6",
        "P95:sigma+curves<=2^63-1"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定曲线起始 sigma；0 由程序随机选择。在采用连续 sigma 的批处理中，后续曲线使用 sigma+i；各曲线后端仍有自己的有效范围。ECM/ECM2 任务行给出非零 sigma 时覆盖此键，否则使用此键；不带 sigma 字段的 ECMSTAGE2 任务也使用此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "p95_dir",
      "field": "p95_dir",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "<dir>",
      "fx": "legacy_notice(P95)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "off",
      "description": [
        "保留旧配置兼容性，设置非空值只产生旧选项提示，不启用新的 Prime95 交接流程。需要交接 ECMSTAGE2 任务时使用 p95_worktodo_path。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "ckpt_seconds",
      "field": "ckpt_seconds",
      "type": "double",
      "default": 600,
      "domain": "<x:R,finite,x>=0>",
      "fx": "checkpoint_period(S1)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "unit": "s",
      "zero": "periodic_off",
      "rules": [
        "Ctrl+C:save",
        "x<0=>0"
      ],
      "description": [
        "设置 Stage1 定期写检查点的间隔，单位为秒。0 关闭定期检查点，负数按 0 处理；仍可通过正常停止或 Ctrl+C 请求保存。实际写盘时机受当前计算后端的安全检查点限制。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "device",
      "field": "device",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 0,
      "domain": "<x:Z,0..device_count-1>",
      "fx": "device(S1,S2)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "description": [
        "选择 GPU 设备编号，从 0 开始。用于 Stage1；Stage2 未显式指定 stage2_device 时也继承此编号。编号对应各可执行文件实际使用的 GPU 后端设备列表。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "gpu_param",
      "field": "gpu_param",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 3,
      "domain": "[0|2|3]",
      "fx": "curve_family(CUDA)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "release_value": 0,
      "first_run_value": 0,
      "parser_override": "gpu_param",
      "rules": [
        "OpenCL:3",
        "S2_save:0",
        "invalid=>3"
      ],
      "values": [
        0,
        2,
        3
      ],
      "description": [
        "选择 GPU Stage1 曲线参数族。当前 CUDA Stage2 消费参数 0 的 save，准备交给它处理时使用 0；OpenCL 路径使用参数 3。内置默认值为 3，但首次启动和发布模板有意写入 0；旧 INI 不会自动改值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "tpi",
      "field": "tpi",
      "type": "u32",
      "default": 8,
      "domain": "[1|2|4|8|16|32]",
      "fx": "TPI(OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "rules": [
        "limbs%effective_TPI=0",
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "设置 OpenCL 每个大整数使用的线程数，需满足有效 TPI 与整数 limb 数的布局约束。CUDA 后端自行按位宽选择 TPI，不使用此键；不要用它调整 CUDA 的线程块大小。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "wg_size",
      "field": "wg_size",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 0,
      "domain": "<x:Z,x>=0>",
      "fx": "WG(OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "zero": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "x<=device_kernel_limit",
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "设置 OpenCL 工作组大小，0 由后端自动选择。显式值必须满足当前设备和内核的限制；CUDA 后端不使用此设置。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "kernel_mul",
      "field": "kernel_mul",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[auto|<id>|<alias>]",
      "fx": "kernel(mul,OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 OpenCL 模乘内核的标识或别名。空值或 auto 由后端选择；用于已知内核的比较和调优，通常保持自动。CUDA 后端忽略此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "kernel_sqr",
      "field": "kernel_sqr",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[auto|<id>|<alias>]",
      "fx": "kernel(sqr,OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 OpenCL 模平方内核的标识或别名。空值或 auto 由后端选择；通常保持自动，CUDA 后端忽略此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "kernel_add",
      "field": "kernel_add",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[auto|<id>|<alias>]",
      "fx": "kernel(add,OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 OpenCL 模加内核的标识或别名。空值或 auto 由后端选择；通常保持自动，CUDA 后端忽略此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "kernel_sub",
      "field": "kernel_sub",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[auto|<id>|<alias>]",
      "fx": "kernel(sub,OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 OpenCL 模减内核的标识或别名。空值或 auto 由后端选择；通常保持自动，CUDA 后端忽略此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage1",
      "key": "kernel_special_mult",
      "field": "kernel_special_mult",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "domain": "[auto|<id>|<alias>]",
      "fx": "kernel(special_mult,OpenCL)",
      "parser": "legacy",
      "empty": "auto",
      "rules": [
        "CUDA:ignored"
      ],
      "description": [
        "指定 OpenCL 特殊乘法内核的标识或别名。空值或 auto 由后端选择；通常保持自动，CUDA 后端忽略此键。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "owner": "stage2",
      "key": "stage2_worktodo",
      "field": "worktodo",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "stage2_worktodo.txt",
      "domain": "<path>",
      "fx": "queue(S2)",
      "parser": "strict",
